<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13250] Use descriptive thread names for async file channels</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13250</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;At now we have several async file channels which don&apos;t use any thread naming notation in their executor services, this causes some troubles identifying what&apos;s happening if you have a thread dump only.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
